            "\n",
            "\n",
            "\\paragraph{Factes Quality.}\n",
            "\n",
            "To estimate the quality and reliability of the generated facets, we conduct a further human verification on the facets.\n",
            "\n",
            "Specifically, we randomly collect 100 inputs from \\OurDataName, along with their corresponding facets (889 facets in total) and instructions (2,265 instructions in total). Then, we ask an experienced human annotator to evaluate the following two metrics:\n",
