            "\n",
            "The final results are shown in Table~\\ref{tab:facets_quality}. These results demonstrate the good quality and utility of the facets generated by our method. It's also worth noting that, after we conducted \"instruction filtering\" (as introduced on \\cref{sec:method}), the input-to-facets correctness increased from 83.28\\\n",
